 "title": "More reasoning adds up to 28 points, but barely moves Sonnet",
 "section": "results",
 "order": 32,
 "caption": "Backdoors caught at each model's highest reasoning setting minus its lowest, at a 2% audit budget. Stronger blue means a bigger gain; the small line is the catch rate before and after.",
 "notes": [
  "The gains are percentage points, not percent: GLM-5.3 goes from 48% to 76% caught.",
  "Sonnet starts at 85%, so it has little room to gain. Its small number is a ceiling, not a weakness.",
  "Mistral Large 4 (-1.8) and Gemini Flash-Lite (-9.0) are left out, as in the draft table. More reasoning made both slightly worse; P03 shows them."
 ],
